Check: `padding` (stress1) before all three of `padding-top`/`-right`/`-left`
(stress2/4/3); `margin` (stress5) before all three of `margin-top`/`-right`/
`-left` (stress6/8/7); `border-width` (stress9) before both
`border-top-width`/`border-left-width` (stress10/11); `inset` (stress12)
before both `top`/`left` (stress13/14) - every one of the nine pairs holds,
in a single generated sheet where the pre-sort (dependency) order
interleaved every shorthand with several unrelated declarations first.
